  "body": "Refs #94\nClaim: cloud/orch\n\n**Problem.** The Depends-on cell of LOT-070 in `docs/LOTS.md` said \"all parsing/network/storage lots\", a gate sentence that `hygiene.py` reports for hand resolution on every pass.\n\n**Change.**\n- The cell now names the two engine lots still open: `055, 057` (#81, #83). The operator decided on #94 (2026-11-12) that LOT-168 (#286) and LOT-184 (#449) do not gate the engine parity.\n- `tooling/roadmap/lots.json` is regenerated by `lots_from_md.py`; that is its only diff.\n\n**Tests.**\n- `python3 -m unittest scripts/tests/test_roadmap.py`: 98 OK.\n- `fold.py --check`: ok.\n- The \"gate sentence\" report of `hygiene.py` is gone on this branch.\n\nDocs only: no App or Packages file, so no macOS jobs. No ledger entry.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CGTbJ8LjeZ6VYEWrtJ)_",
